'' A FLOAT FOR COUNTER WITH NO 'step' ADVANCES BY 1. The implicit step was ConstInt( 1 ) on an f64,
'' which went out as 'const f64 0': every such loop ran forever. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/for-float-step.bas -o tests/codegen/forfloatstep.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/forfloatstep.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  1 2 3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  0.5 1.5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  0.25 1.25
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  2.5 3.5 end 4.5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3 2 1
